  "ingredients": [
    "1 (12 ounce) package uncooked tri-color rotini pasta",
    "10 slices bacon",
    "1 cup mayonnaise",
    "3 tablespoons dry ranch salad dressing mix",
    "0.5 teaspoon garlic pepper",
    "0.25 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 cup milk, or as needed",
    "1 large tomato, chopped",
    "1 (4.25 ounce) can sliced black olives",
    "1 cup shredded sharp Cheddar cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ypQ-iWnk_pzFMlBZuj4NQ0J1Big=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69226-bacon-ranch-pasta-salad-DDMFS-step-01-0850-c279a3ebbede44d6ac979e34ee0439c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69226/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil; cook rotini at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5-5lt2Ba1MrB0cijblouR8sVg6I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69226-bacon-ranch-pasta-salad-DDMFS-step-01-1-0855-96ef15e778ab4fcc867b6fcb6ef1aabb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69226/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a skillet over medium-high heat and cook until evenly brown. Drain and chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FKR9A3qbkPWpcY_g1XWzT1gqnus=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69226-bacon-ranch-pasta-salad-DDMFS-step-02-1-0858-f9bca2ffe1e84f5ab3dbc3ad3d551201.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69226/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix mayonnaise, ranch dressing mix, garlic pepper, and garlic powder together in a large bowl. Stir in milk until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kK4brbFLrxjpP_S6KuIHo1Jf0pA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69226-bacon-ranch-pasta-salad-DDMFS-step-03-0865-ae98418ede994ffb9f6174064ddc1cbc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69226/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place rotini, bacon, tomato, black olives, and cheese in a bowl and toss to coat with dressing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PtYDEP4g0tAzc9XUXNePmOJiQ8o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69226-bacon-ranch-pasta-salad-DDMFS-step-04-0866-36b6a2f964b44d28b02b98e118045d5c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69226/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and chill at least 1 hour in the refrigerator. Toss with additional milk if the salad seems a little dry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AQm3wwM_OoOW2inR6MOP5w3mt24=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69226-bacon-ranch-pasta-salad-DDMFS-4x3-0903-b32a48b8a875419cba73748c4cd02d70.jpg"
